  "problem": "Find the general solution to the equation $\\operatorname{tan}\u2061x=\\sqrt{3}$ in the form $x=\\theta +n\\cdot b$ where $\\theta \\in [0,{180}^{\u2218}),$ $n$ is an integer and $b$ is the period in degrees.\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}${}^{\u2218}+\\,n\\,\\cdot $\n{{field-2}}${}^{\u2218}$",
